<%
  // SkillSprint brand mark v3 — back to a plain "S", but as real SVG
  // text in the site's display font (Bricolage Grotesque) rather than a
  // hand-drawn path. Letting the browser render the actual font glyph
  // means it's guaranteed to look right, unlike a freehand curve.
  // Uses currentColor so it always matches .brand-mark's color:#fff.
  //
  // This is the ONE logo file every page includes, so changing it here
  // changes it everywhere at once — sidebar, landing, onboarding, all
  // of it in sync going forward.
%>
<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <text x="11" y="16.5" text-anchor="middle"
        font-family="'Bricolage Grotesque','Inter',-apple-system,sans-serif"
        font-weight="800" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">S</text>
</svg>
